# The release signing key and its passwords. A keystore belongs to whoever
# ships the app; the build reads this file only when the environment has not
# already supplied the same four values.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# The Kotlin compiler's own scratch directory. `.kotlin/errors/` collects a log
# per failed incremental compile, which is a build artefact of one machine on
# one afternoon and belongs in the repository no more than `build/` does.
.kotlin/
